OL,3,GNEWSAAirport bidding for more
OL,4,Apassengers and later flights
OL,5,
OL,6,FBelfast City Airport is seeking
OL,7,Fpermission to extend its evening
OL,8,Fflights from 21:30 BST to 22:30 as part
OL,9,Fof a major expansion plan.
OL,11,FThe operator also wants to increase its
OL,12,Fannual flight limit by 27%, raising the
OL,13,Fcap from 48,000 to 61,000 movements a
OL,14,Fyear.
OL,16,FThe changes would require a
OL,17,Fmodification to the airport's legally
OL,18,Fbinding Planning Agreement, with the
OL,19,Ffinal decision likely to rest with the
OL,20,Finfrastructure minister.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
